hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"337","On the authority of Bundar, on the authority of Ubayd Allah ibn Abdul Majeed, on the authority of Ibn Abi Dhib, on the authority of Sa`id al-Maqbari, on the authority of al-Qaqa` ibn Hakim, on the authority of Jabir Ibn Abdullah, he said: “We used to pray Morocco with the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, then we would go to Bani Salamah and see the sites of the arrows.”"
"338","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak Al-Mukhurami, narrated to us by Yahya bin Ishaq, narrated to us by Hammad bin Salamah, on the authority of Thabit, on the authority of Anas, That they used to “perform the Maghrib prayer with the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, then they would return and one of them would see the sites of his arrows.”"
